    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、周期信号与非周期信号",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            108,
            398,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)周期信号定义：周而复始，无始无终 $f(t)=f(t\\pm nT)$ ， $n=0,\\pm1,\\pm2,\\cdots$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            133,
            808,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)常见周期信号的判断：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            157,
            386,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①单个三角信号的周期：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            182,
            379,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nA \\cos (\\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi) \\text {或} A \\sin (\\omega_ {0} t + \\varphi) \\Rightarrow \\text {周期} T = \\frac {2 \\pi}{\\omega_ {0}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            207,
            668,
            241
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②多三角信号相加(和信号)的周期:",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            251,
            465,
            267
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "和信号为周期信号的判断方法：每个子信号均为周期信号，且各子信号周期存在最小公倍数，则和信号为周期信号，周期为该最小公倍数，否则为非周期信号。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            275,
            810,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例如： $\\cos(2t)+\\cos(3t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            324,
            364,
            342
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例如： $\\cos(2t)+\\cos(\\pi t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            372,
            364,
            390
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③单个复指数信号的周期：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            466,
            396,
            480
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ne ^ {\\pm j \\theta} = c o s \\theta \\pm j s i n \\theta , T = 2 \\pi\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            386,
            489,
            608,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 3: 求 $e^{j10t}$ 的周期。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            513,
            354,
            529
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【新增】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            631,
            257,
            648
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$[5sin(8t)]^2$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            655,
            277,
            673
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "6",
        "bbox": [
