    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "④观察法：周期信号与非周期信号的关系：",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            522,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一般周期信号",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            133,
            297,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {T} (t) = \\sum_ {n = - \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {0} (t - n T), n = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\dots\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            300,
            155,
            692,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "有始周期",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            275,
            265,
            290
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {T} (t) = \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} f _ {0} (t - n T), n = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\dots\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            307,
            296,
            687,
            343
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "正负交替信号",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            395,
            299,
            410
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {T} (t) = \\sum_ {n = - \\infty} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} f _ {0} (t - n T), n = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\dots\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            273,
            418,
            721,
            461
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/604387c78c5fefa8cfb5e7dce04a5ee94ba86f048acfba3d72b7bd5c48b2a597.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            221,
            483,
            400,
            593
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/f6efad439c29db7c097ef5ac6d5048de6293042efc8c4253e6734fc3055cded2.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            465,
            769,
            590
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "相较于 $\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}f_{0}(t-nT)$ ， $\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}f_{0}(t-nT)$ 使图形正、负交替，故周期从 T 变为 2T。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            598,
            805,
            666
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【新增】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            706,
            257,
            722
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\sum_ {n = - \\infty} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} [ u (t - n T) - u (t - n T - T) ]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            337,
            728,
            657,
            771
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
