    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、信号分解：偶(even)信号 $f_{e}(t)$ 、奇(odd)信号 $f_{o}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            108,
            608,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/fcac0dc1314ade147bdf872c2731675eda0efacf97f9eeb01b5fc57b6fe7aaa4.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td>信号</td><td>波形</td></tr><tr><td> $f(t) = f_e(t) + f_o(t)$ </td><td><img src=\"images/256ac90110a163274b404f3d32a9fa3c76988e2a943393d864693752504fc8f0.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td> $f_e(t) = \\frac{f(t) + f(-t)}{2}$ </td><td><img src=\"images/33c6500c7c20db908c20f5b2f92f7bd8ae97cfefcc0ea6bd2e2a4c57324d0e97.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td> $f_o(t) = \\frac{f(t) - f(-t)}{2}$ </td><td><img src=\"images/386f0142f288b62847dc98d7a5b21a27ce13c4941003739b7d16e846b2d009bb.jpg\"/></td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            130,
            816,
            404
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 4: 求 $f(t)=e^{jt}$ 的偶信号和奇信号?",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            427,
            482,
            444
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "8",
        "bbox": [
            937,
