        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、直流(direct-current, DC)分量与交流(alternating-current, AC)分量设原信号为 $f(t)$ ，分解为直流分量 $f_{D}$ 与交流分量 $f_{A}(t)$ ，表示为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            111,
            800,
            152
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = f _ {D} + f _ {A} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            423,
            159,
            569,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "直流分量的求解: 直流分量=信号的平均值, 是一个与时间无关的常数",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            182,
            742,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {D} = \\lim _ {T \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {1}{T} \\int_ {- \\frac {T}{2}} ^ {\\frac {T}{2}} f (t) d t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            403,
            205,
            589,
            254
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①如果原信号是非周期信号， $f(t)$ 存在 $f(-\\infty)$ 和 $f(\\infty)$ 且中间瞬态过程可忽略，可用公式求直流 $f_{D}$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            282,
            800,
            323
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {D} = \\frac {f (\\infty) + f (- \\infty)}{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            410,
            328,
            584,
            362
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例6：求下图所示信号的直流分量。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            391,
            463,
            407
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/8daebd07b68aeddb6978fb26ae4e4f7c917237cf202fd2ed3b997efb4a08a297.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            403,
            416,
            584,
            508
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②如果原信号是周期信号,上式则可以省去取极限的过程,而且积分限可以取任意一个周期,即",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            533,
            811,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {D} = \\frac {1}{T} \\int_ {t _ {0}} ^ {t _ {0} + T} f (t) d t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            413,
            581,
            581,
            619
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 5: 求下图所示信号的直流分量。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            644,
            463,
            660
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/0eac25f4bc9a9b6991c8090356c46ae2d2fda0004ca31498456fd2976b393433.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
